# 4. Build the Orbbec Godot Interface

Create a small C++ GDExtension around Orbbec SDK v2.

Use the official `godot-cpp` GDExtension mechanism rather than modifying Godot itself.

The extension should expose a Godot class such as:

```text
GeminiCamera
```

Minimum API:

```gdscript
GeminiCamera.start()
GeminiCamera.stop()

GeminiCamera.is_running()

GeminiCamera.get_color_image()
GeminiCamera.get_depth_image()

GeminiCamera.get_color_width()
GeminiCamera.get_color_height()

GeminiCamera.get_depth_width()
GeminiCamera.get_depth_height()

GeminiCamera.get_depth_at(x, y)

GeminiCamera.deproject_pixel(x, y, depth)

GeminiCamera.get_timestamp()
```

Later we may add:

```gdscript
GeminiCamera.get_point_cloud()
GeminiCamera.get_intrinsics()
GeminiCamera.get_device_info()
```

Do not expose raw Orbbec SDK objects directly to GDScript.

Wrap them behind simple Godot types.

