# 5. Camera Configuration

Start with a stable, modest configuration.

Target approximately:

```text
RGB:   1280x720 or nearest stable mode
Depth: compatible D2C resolution
FPS:   30
```

Do not optimize resolution prematurely.

The primary target is:

```text
stable 30 FPS tracking
```

Enable RGB/depth synchronization when supported.

Enable **Depth-to-Color alignment (D2C)**.

The critical requirement is:

```text
depth[x, y]
```

must correspond to the same physical image location as:

```text
rgb[x, y]
```

after alignment.

Without this, joint depth lookup will be wrong.

