# 7. Feed Gemini RGB Into MediaPipe

Convert the Gemini RGB frame into a format accepted by GDMP/MediaPipe.

Conceptually:

```text
Orbbec RGB buffer
      ↓
Godot Image
      ↓
MediaPipeImage
      ↓
MediaPipePoseLandmarker
```

Avoid unnecessary image copies where practical, but correctness comes before zero-copy optimization.

Measure the cost before trying to optimize it.

The pose processing pipeline should run asynchronously if GDMP's API supports it cleanly.

Do not block Godot's render loop waiting for inference.

