# 18. Derived Body State

Add basic derived states after 3D tracking works.

## Crouch

Compare:

```text
hip height
knee angle
torso height
```

against the person's standing baseline.

## Jump

Detect upward body-root velocity and both feet leaving their recent floor level.

Do not rely on a single-frame threshold.

## Arms up

For example:

```text
both wrists above shoulders/head
```

## Hands together

Use true 3D distance:

```gdscript
left_hand.position_3d.distance_to(
    right_hand.position_3d
)
```

This is better than comparing only screen-space positions.

