# 24. Threading

Camera capture and MediaPipe inference should not unnecessarily block Godot's rendering thread.

Preferred conceptual architecture:

```text
camera capture thread
        ↓
latest RGB/depth FrameSet
        ↓
pose worker / asynchronous inference
        ↓
latest tracking state
        ↓
Godot main thread
```

Prefer dropping stale frames to building a queue of old frames.

For real-time interaction:

```text
fresh frame > every frame
```

Do not let latency continuously increase under load.

---

